topical diphenylcyclopropenone and 5% minoxidil: a clinical and immunopathologic evaluation', 'abstract': 'BACKGROUND   
Topical diphenylcyclopropenone (DPCP) and minoxidil have been used in the treatment of alopecia areata with variable    
results. OBJECTIVE This study was designed to evaluate the efficacy of DPCP alone or in combination with topical 5%     
